  "ingredients": [
    "6 tablespoons butter, divided",
    "6 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves - cut into cubes",
    "4 cloves garlic, minced, divided",
    "1 tablespoon Italian seasoning",
    "1 pound fettuccini pasta",
    "1 onion, diced",
    "1 (8 ounce) package sliced mushrooms",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon salt",
    "0.75 teaspoon ground white pepper",
    "3 cups milk",
    "1 cup half-and-half",
    "8 ounces shredded Colby-Monterey Jack cheese",
    "0.75 cup grated Parmesan cheese",
    "3 roma (plum) tomatoes, diced",
    "0.5 cup sour cream"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/v-U6mEAurXJvcf7I7wMVnuQhR1E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-25303-chicken-fettuccini-alfredo-VAT-step-01-de7c9a0c92a24e119c8dae2267bc1051.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25303/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 2 tablespoons butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Add chicken, 1/2 of the garlic, and Italian seasoning. Cook until chicken is no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). Remove from the skillet and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ntAztnUrk-hNzKo-tpJLAwDxMo4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-25303-chicken-fettuccini-alfredo-VAT-step-02-8b57725dfbea4abfbb5f7100c7ddc829.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25303/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill a large pot with lightly salted water and bring to a rolling boil. Cook fettuccine at a boil until tender yet firm to the bite, 8 to 10 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Re_mjWMfm82YgAp4a7Qu8ajNtLc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-25303-chicken-fettuccini-alfredo-VAT-step-03-bf9d71b82a1b4dcbb92040e4e03073b0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25303/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, melt remaining 4 tablespoons butter in the skillet. Add onion, mushrooms, and remaining garlic; sauté until onion is transparent, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cjPQ2ufI1QTzuOKgt9pyqeyfdM0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-25303-chicken-fettuccini-alfredo-VAT-step-04-8ca5e5be274e455cac9e4dbcf3bfd9ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25303/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in flour, salt, and pepper; cook for 2 minutes. Slowly add milk and half-and-half; cook and stir until smooth and creamy. Stir in both cheeses until melted.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wLK_lTVJADLS3EXtwRoiTOfxHaw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-25303-chicken-fettuccini-alfredo-VAT-step-05-593bc8c1e5564a99b6636165dfcf5542.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25303/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in chicken mixture, tomatoes, and sour cream. Serve over cooked fettuccini.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MaklufU4mbBW4ZE1szOS2eKpUqA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-25303-chicken-fettuccini-alfredo-VAT-step-06-b498097ea761417d9573df5ac2df3fbe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25303/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bw9mly-m5-is6-VkP9t9bGScyw4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-25303-chicken-fettuccini-alfredo-VAT-hero-02-4x3-ff002edfb5184877acdd37c16ea4936b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25303/step_07.webp"
    }
